    "rulings": [
      {
        "answer": "It refers to cards with the specified word or icon included in \"name, trait, effect, inherited effect, <Overflow X>, jogress, digivolution requirements, burst digivolution\". For example, a card with the text \"Knightmon\" refers to a card whose name is \"Dark Knightmon\" or whose effect says \"Knightmon\".",
